      "from": "owner",
      "minute": 0,
      "text": "Quick update for the library volunteers chat."
    },
    {
      "from": "peer",
      "minute": 1,
      "text": "Go ahead; I am sorting the shared supplies."
    },
    {
      "from": "owner",
      "minute": 2,
      "text": "I teach bookbinding at Willow Room every winter."
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 3,
      "text": "Understood: Amina Noor says I teach bookbinding at Willow Room every winter."
    },
    {
      "from": "peer",
      "minute": 4,
      "text": "To keep us separate: I am Amin Noor, and that is not my role or preference."
    },
    {
      "from": "owner",
      "minute": 5,
      "text": "The workshop is on 2026-11-06."
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 6,
      "text": "I will keep that provisional date in the notes."
    },
    {
      "from": "peer",
      "minute": 7,
      "text": "The paper order arrived wet."
    },
    {
      "from": "owner",
      "minute": 8,
      "text": "Only the outer wrapping was damaged."
    },
    {
      "from": "peer",
      "minute": 9,
      "text": "Can we reuse the cardboard backing?"
    },
    {
      "from": "owner",
      "minute": 10,
      "text": "Yes, it makes good cutting mats."
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 11,
      "text": "We can return to the schedule once the supplies are sorted."
    },
    {
      "from": "peer",
      "minute": 12,
      "text": "The glue needs time to warm up."
    },
    {
      "from": "owner",
      "minute": 13,
      "text": "Let us set out the brushes first."
    },
    {
      "from": "peer",
      "minute": 14,
      "text": "I found the missing bone folder."
    },
    {
      "from": "owner",
      "minute": 15,
      "text": "Please count the folding boards too."
    },
    {
      "from": "peer",
      "minute": 16,
      "text": "Did the weather affect the delivery?"
    },
    {
      "from": "owner",
      "minute": 17,
      "text": "No, the delivery arrived dry and on time."
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 18,
      "text": "Good; there is no delivery delay to track."
    },
    {
      "from": "peer",
      "minute": 19,
      "text": "The radio forecast sounded much worse."
    },
    {
      "from": "owner",
      "minute": 20,
      "text": "That forecast was for the next town."
    },
    {
      "from": "peer",
      "minute": 21,
      "text": "All right, back to the room setup."
    },
    {
      "from": "owner",
      "minute": 22,
      "text": "Today the spare scissors are under the green cushion."
    },
    {
      "from": "peer",
      "minute": 23,
      "text": "I will use that location today, then put it away."
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 24,
      "text": "Only today; I will not treat that location as permanent."
    },
    {
      "from": "owner",
      "minute": 25,
      "text": "Back to the date we discussed earlier."
    },
    {
      "from": "peer",
      "minute": 26,
      "text": "Has the booking changed?"
    },
    {
      "from": "owner",
      "minute": 27,
      "text": "The workshop is now 2026-11-13, not November 6."
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 28,
      "text": "The later correction takes precedence over the provisional date."
    },
    {
      "from": "peer",
      "minute": 29,
      "text": "Thanks, that answers my scheduling question."
